[283.32, "o", "\u001b[1;35m\u23fa Claude\u001b[0m\r\n  All pieces are built and verified. Summary:\r\n  \r\n  **Built:**\r\n  - `src/lib/grades.js` \u2014 `toGPA(input, scale)` for GPA/percentage/letter, `GRADE_OPTIONS` + `LETTER_GRADE_OPTIONS` fo\r\n  r the UI\r\n  - `src/lib/match.js` \u2014 `matchUniversities(profile, universities)`: academic fit (60%, full credit at/above minGPA, l\r\n  inear down to 0 at \u22120.4), interest fit (40%, tag overlap), Safety/Match/Reach labeling, sorted by score\r\n  - `src/lib/countryFlags.js` \u2014 country \u2192 flag emoji helper\r\n  - `ProfileForm` \u2014 scale selector, grade input (number or letter dropdown depending on scale), toggleable interest ch\r\n  ips, \"Find my matches\" button\r\n  - `UniversityCard` + `ResultsGrid` \u2014 animated SVG score ring, color-coded badge, field chips, tuition/living/fee/tot\r\n  al costs, ranking, website link, CSS-only empty state and \"no results\" state\r\n  - `StatsBar` \u2014 total matches, per-label counts, cheapest option, best-fit country (by avg score)\r\n  - `FilterBar` \u2014 region chips, country chips, tuition/total-cost sliders, reach-schools toggle\r\n  - `App.jsx` \u2014 wired with `useState`/`useMemo` only, filters applied after matching\r\n  \r\n  **Verified:**\r\n  - `npm run build` passes (Vite production build, 43 modules)\r\n  - `npm run test` runs `scripts/test-match.mjs` with \r\n\r\n"]
